        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW1RDDSBR, Elegant Reed Front Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Elegant Reed Door Pull is available in 18 inch or 24 inch lengths. Made by First Impressions, these front door handles are part of the Delaware Collection that features traditional designs that are beautifully styled. They can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW01-specifications.gif?v=1704354502\" width=\"478\" height=\"231\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions DLW1RDDSBR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DLW1RDDSBR Delaware Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CF8301R-detail-picture.jpg?v=1704354503\"><b>First Impressions DLW1 Detailed View</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262277\"><b>First Impressions DLW1RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DLW1018RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLW1024RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Elegant Reed Door Pull",
                "description": "The Elegant Reed Door Pull is available in 18 inch or 24 inch lengths. Made by First Impressions, these front door handles are part of the Delaware Collection that features traditional designs that are beautifully styled. They can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from a wide array of finishes. \r\n",
